{"seq":1,"slug":"the-foundational-text","title":"《博弈论与经济行为》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games/the-foundational-text","wordCount":1732,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"博弈论与经济行为\">《博弈论与经济行为》</h1><p>《博弈论与经济行为》（Theory of Games and Economic Behavior）是冯·诺依曼与经济学家摩根斯特恩合著、1944年由普林斯顿大学出版社出版的巨著，约600页。它把冯·诺依曼1928年证明的极小极大定理扩展为一套完整的策略互动理论，并系统应用于经济学，被公认为博弈论作为独立学科的诞生标志。本篇聚焦这部<strong>著作</strong>——它的成书过程、数学骨架（极小极大定理、期望效用、合作博弈与特征函数）与结构；它作为&quot;一门新科学&quot;的学科意义放在姊妹篇 <a href=\"a-new-science\">一门新的科学</a> 展开，对经济学的具体改造见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/transforming-economics\">变革经济学</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>全书的数学骨架由三块构成，它们分别回答&quot;稳定解存在吗&quot;&quot;收益如何度量&quot;&quot;多人合作如何分配&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>骨架</th>\n<th>核心对象</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极小极大定理</td>\n<td>支付矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、混合策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>二人零和的稳定值与存在性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望效用公理</td>\n<td>效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不确定性下偏好如何被量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作博弈解概念</td>\n<td>特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、稳定集</td>\n<td>哪些联盟形成、收益如何分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>理论根脉</strong>：全书的逻辑起点是冯·诺依曼 1928 年证明的极小极大定理。</li>\n<li><strong>重要边界</strong>：本书并未给出非合作博弈的一般解——纳什均衡是 1950 年纳什的贡献。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成书-数学家与经济学家的六年合作\">成书：数学家与经济学家的六年合作</h2><p>冯·诺依曼早在1928年的论文《社会博弈理论》（Mathematische Annalen 100: 295–320）中就证明了二人零和博弈的极小极大定理。但把它发展成一门可应用于经济学的理论，得益于他在普林斯顿与摩根斯特恩的相遇。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键事实</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作者</td>\n<td>冯·诺依曼、摩根斯特恩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出版</td>\n<td>1944年，普林斯顿大学出版社</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>篇幅</td>\n<td>约600页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论根</td>\n<td>冯·诺依曼1928年极小极大定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作起点</td>\n<td>二人1938年后在普林斯顿结识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学科地位</td>\n<td>博弈论的奠基之作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>摩根斯特恩起初设想写一篇文章，最终在冯·诺依曼的数学推动下扩展为一部巨著。分工大致是：冯·诺依曼提供全部数学骨架，摩根斯特恩贡献经济学动机与诠释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极小极大定理-理论的数学心脏\">极小极大定理：理论的数学心脏</h2><p>全书的逻辑起点是二人零和博弈中的极小极大定理。设玩家1选策略以最大化其保底收益，玩家2选策略以最小化对手收益，定理断言存在一个鞍点，使二者相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></munder><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi></munder><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{x}\\min_{y} x^{\\top} A\\, y \\;=\\; \\min_{y}\\max_{x} x^{\\top} A\\, y \\;=\\; v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7352em;vertical-align:-0.8361em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8361em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7352em;vertical-align:-0.8361em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8361em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是支付矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x, y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 是双方的混合策略（概率分布），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 即博弈的值。</p>\n<p>它的深刻之处在于：<strong>在严格对抗下，理性双方的最优行为有唯一确定的&quot;价值&quot;</strong>，这把&quot;谁会赢、能保证多少&quot;从直觉变成可证明的数学命题。混合策略（按概率随机化）的引入是关键——纯策略下鞍点未必存在，引入随机化后存在性才得到保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  M28[&quot;1928 极小极大定理&lt;br/&gt;二人零和&quot;] --&gt; EU[&quot;期望效用公理&lt;br/&gt;可量化的偏好&quot;]&#10;  EU --&gt; COOP[&quot;合作博弈&lt;br/&gt;特征函数 v(S)&quot;]&#10;  COOP --&gt; SOL[&quot;解概念&lt;br/&gt;稳定集&quot;]&#10;  SOL --&gt; ECON[&quot;经济学应用&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  M28[\"1928 极小极大定理&lt;br/&gt;二人零和\"] --&gt; EU[\"期望效用公理&lt;br/&gt;可量化的偏好\"]\n  EU --&gt; COOP[\"合作博弈&lt;br/&gt;特征函数 v(S)\"]\n  COOP --&gt; SOL[\"解概念&lt;br/&gt;稳定集\"]\n  SOL --&gt; ECON[\"经济学应用\"]</pre><h2 id=\"期望效用-让-偏好-可被数学处理\">期望效用：让&quot;偏好&quot;可被数学处理</h2><p>博弈分析需要先量化&quot;收益&quot;。书中（尤其1947年第二版的附录）给出了<strong>期望效用公理</strong>：只要个体的偏好满足完备性、传递性、连续性、独立性几条公理，就存在一个效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>，使得理性人等价于最大化期望效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[u]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>直观含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完备性</td>\n<td>任意两个选项可比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传递性</td>\n<td>偏好不循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续性</td>\n<td>不存在&quot;无穷好&quot;的跳变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立性</td>\n<td>共同成分不改变偏好次序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这一框架的影响远超博弈论，成为整个现代决策论与微观经济学的基石。它的权衡在于：现实中的人常系统性违背这些公理（后来卡尼曼与特沃斯基的前景理论正是对此的修正），但作为&quot;理性基准&quot;它无可替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合作博弈与解概念\">合作博弈与解概念</h2><p>全书篇幅最大的部分并非零和博弈，而是<strong>多人合作博弈</strong>。冯·诺依曼引入特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示任一联盟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 能独立保证的收益，把&quot;哪些联盟会形成、如何分配收益&quot;形式化。</p>\n<p>他提出的解概念是&quot;稳定集&quot;（von Neumann–Morgenstern 解）：一组分配方案，集内方案互不支配、集外方案均被集内某方案支配。这是历史上第一个严格的合作博弈解概念。</p>\n<p>权衡与局限值得点明：稳定集<strong>不一定唯一、甚至不一定存在</strong>（卢卡斯1968年构造了反例），计算也极困难。后来沙普利值、核心等更易处理的解概念正是为弥补这些不足而生——这恰说明这部著作是&quot;开端&quot;而非&quot;终点&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构与阅读建议\">结构与阅读建议</h2><p>全书由抽象到应用层层推进，对今天的读者而言并不易读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>公理化方法</strong>：从效用公理出发，步步演绎，数学密度极高。</li>\n<li><strong>重零和、更重合作</strong>：真正的篇幅与雄心在多人合作博弈。</li>\n<li><strong>应用偏经济直觉</strong>：经济学应用多为概念示范，而非可直接落地的模型。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>常见反模式是<strong>把它等同于&quot;纳什均衡那套&quot;</strong>：事实上纳什均衡是1950年纳什的贡献，本书并未给出非合作博弈的一般解，它的核心是极小极大与合作博弈。理解这一历史分层，才能准确定位这部著作的真实贡献。学科层面的意义见 <a href=\"a-new-science\">一门新的科学</a>，策略推理的思想方法见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/strategic-thinking/minimax-and-strategy\">极小极大与策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>《博弈论与经济行为》是冯·诺依曼与摩根斯特恩合著、1944 年出版的约 600 页巨著，被公认为博弈论作为独立学科的诞生标志。</li>\n<li>其数学心脏是二人零和博弈的极小极大定理，它把&quot;能保证多少&quot;从直觉变成可证明的命题。</li>\n<li>期望效用公理用完备性、传递性、连续性、独立性把偏好量化，成为现代决策论与微观经济学的基石。</li>\n<li>全书篇幅最大的部分是多人合作博弈，其&quot;稳定集&quot;解概念是历史上第一个严格的合作博弈解概念。</li>\n<li>稳定集不一定唯一、甚至不一定存在，且本书未给出非合作博弈的一般解——它是一部&quot;开端&quot;而非&quot;终点&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"a-new-science\">一门新的科学</a> — 博弈论作为独立学科的诞生与扩散</li>\n<li>核心贡献：<a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-game-theory/game-theory-and-economics\">博弈论与经济学</a></li>\n<li>思想方法：<a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/strategic-thinking/game-theoretic-reasoning\">博弈论式推理</a></li>\n<li>来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theory_of_Games_and_Economic_Behavior\">Theory of Games and Economic Behavior — Wikipedia</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"《博弈论与经济行为》","id":"博弈论与经济行为"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成书：数学家与经济学家的六年合作","id":"成书-数学家与经济学家的六年合作"},{"level":2,"text":"极小极大定理：理论的数学心脏","id":"极小极大定理-理论的数学心脏"},{"level":2,"text":"期望效用：让\"偏好\"可被数学处理","id":"期望效用-让-偏好-可被数学处理"},{"level":2,"text":"合作博弈与解概念","id":"合作博弈与解概念"},{"level":2,"text":"结构与阅读建议","id":"结构与阅读建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"计算机的蓝图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/the-edvac-report/blueprint-of-the-computer"},"next":{"title":"一门新的科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games/a-new-science"}}